# `vendor/gemvc` — framework source map

Treat as **read-only**. Change app code or Composer constraints; do not patch vendor.

## Start here

| Path | Use when |
|------|----------|
| `library/.cursorrules` | AI hard rules for GEMVC 5.x |
| `library/README.md` | Ecosystem overview, layer guides index |
| `library/src/core/ApiService.php` | **Recommended** public base (all servers); uses `ApiServiceSharedTrait` |
| `library/src/core/ApiServiceSharedTrait.php` | Shared: `requireAuth`, `requireRateLimit*`, `callController` |
| `library/src/core/SwooleApiService.php` | **Deprecated** thin subclass of `ApiService`; `safeValidate*` |
| `library/src/core/RateLimiter.php` | Drivers apcu/redis/both/none; scopes ip/token/both; no auto-fallback; FAIL_MODE |
| `library/src/core/AuthException.php` / `RateLimitException.php` | Thrown by require*; Bootstrap → 401/403/429 |
| `library/src/core/Bootstrap.php` | Convention routing `/api/{Service}/{method}`, global rate env |
| `library/src/core/Controller.php` | `createModel`, `createList` |
| `library/src/http/Request.php` | schemas, auth, map*, findable/filterable/sortable |
| `library/src/http/Response.php` | JSON response factories |
| `library/src/http/JWTToken.php` | access/refresh/login tokens; set `$token->role` for `auth([...])` |
| `library/src/database/Table.php` | query fluent API, `setPrimaryKey`, `selectById`, `beginTransaction` / `forUpdate` |
| `library/src/database/ViewTable.php` | SQL views: `defineView`, `viewDependsOn`, read-only row writes |
| `library/src/database/ViewGenerator.php` | CREATE/REPLACE/DROP VIEW (used by migrate) |
| `library/src/database/TableMigrateOrder.php` | FK + viewDependsOn order for `db:migrate --all` |
| `library/src/database/Schema.php` | migration constraints (`primary`, `foreignKey`, …) |
| `library/src/database/DatabaseManagerFactory.php` | Connection manager selection — **not** for app-level multi-step money (use Table tx) |
| `library/src/CLI/commands/DbMigrate.php` | `db:migrate ClassName` or `db:migrate --all` (tables + ViewTable) |
| `helper/README.md` | CryptHelper, TypeChecker types |
| `http-client/README.md` | outbound HTTP |
| `cli-base/AI-Assistant.md` | CLI command / generator contracts |
| `apm-contracts/`, `apm-tracekit/` | APM provider contracts |

## Notes

- Composer **dist** may omit `docs/ai/` and `docs/guides/` — rely on `.cursorrules`, README, and `src/`
- Prefer `ApiService` / `ProtectedApiService` on all servers; OpenSwoole `Swoole*` names are deprecated thin subclasses

- Connection packages implement DB under `Table`; prefer Table/`ViewTable`/QueryBuilder over raw PDO in app code
- SQL views: extend **`ViewTable`**, migrate with `db:migrate` — do **not** invent PDO `CREATE VIEW` helpers unless bypassing the framework on purpose
